      "name": "Sourabh",
      "created_at": "2026-03-20T11:22:33.930Z",
      "cooked": "<p>When i am creating production plan with finished Goods BOM and linked sub assembly BOM against the same, it is showing below error when reserving stock for the items mentioned in the BOM available in the warehouse.</p>\n<p>If i untick the reserve stock option then it will allow me to submit the production plan or else it will not allow.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/e/b/eb8ccf9485f0fae2a8da6fe94e39375f7de0644e.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/eb8ccf9485f0fae2a8da6fe94e39375f7de0644e\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb8ccf9485f0fae2a8da6fe94e39375f7de0644e_2_690x110.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"xBLTgF9EQP5KgYWLd4Q3dLYGOlw\" width=\"690\" height=\"110\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb8ccf9485f0fae2a8da6fe94e39375f7de0644e_2_690x110.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb8ccf9485f0fae2a8da6fe94e39375f7de0644e_2_1035x165.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/e/b/eb8ccf9485f0fae2a8da6fe94e39375f7de0644e_2_1380x220.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"7C7C7C\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1775×284 33.7 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>",
