      "id": 496223,
      "username": "ssp.1401",
      "name": "Sourabh",
      "created_at": "2026-03-23T07:21:57.278Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yes tried doing the same again with again creating BOM and mapping sub assembly BOM against the same. It seems it is a bug right now in version 16. It would be really helpful if any one can test it in their 16 version to check if this is working or not.</p>\n<p>Steps:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Create BOM for finished product and sub-assembly product and map the assembly BOM in the final product BOM</li>\n<li>Update stocks for sub-assembly and raw materials in ERP and create production plan for finished product</li>\n<li>Tick Mark Reserve Stock before submitting the production plan</li>\n<li>Please check after the above steps whether it allows to reserve the stock or giving same reference error.</li>\n</ul>",
